flowchart TD
    Start([Will abre betboom.com]) --> Login{Logado?}
    Login -->|Nao| DoLogin[Faz login] --> Login
    Login -->|Sim| BacBo[Clica em Bac Bo Live]

    BacBo --> Inject[manifest.json injeta 3 scripts]
    Inject --> Main[injected.js MAIN world override WebSocket]
    Inject --> Iso[content.js ISOLATED world]
    Inject --> Cali[calibrator-main.js API console]

    Main -.postMessage.-> Iso

    Iso --> OverlayInit[Overlay.inicializar]
    OverlayInit --> AutoStart{bb-paradoManual==true?}
    AutoStart -->|Sim| AutoOff[Badge: AutoStart DESLIGADO Aguarda click INICIAR]
    AutoStart -->|Nao| Poll[Poll 1s ate WS evo-game OU 60s]
    Poll --> AutoOn[Badge AutoStart ATIVO Bot iniciado automaticamente]
    AutoOff -.click INICIAR.-> Iniciar
    AutoOn --> Iniciar[iniciarBot]

    Iniciar --> Collect[Collector.iniciar + DecisionEngine.iniciar]
    Collect --> CallbackReg[Collector.onNovoResultado callback REGISTRADO]
    CallbackReg --> ButtonState[Botao vira REINICIAR laranja]

    Iso --> WaitWS{Frame WS chegou?}
    WaitWS -->|Nao| WaitWS
    WaitWS -->|Sim| Parse[content.js parseia frame]

    Parse --> CollectFIFO[collector.js atualiza FIFO 6x26 signature gid]
    CollectFIFO --> SigCheck{Signature ja vista?}
    SigCheck -->|Sim| Skip[Ignora - idempotencia]
    SigCheck -->|Nao| Pipeline[PatternEngine.analisar 18 WMSG SOMENTE]

    Pipeline --> WmsgMatch{Algum dos 18 WMSG bateu?}
    WmsgMatch -->|Nao| Aguardando[Badge Aguardando padrao WMSG bb-padrao=Aguardando]
    WmsgMatch -->|Sim| Decision[robo-runtime 7 checkpoints]

    Decision --> CP1{1.VALIDATE_HISTORY integro?}
    CP1 -->|Nao| Abort[Aborta rodada]
    CP1 -->|Sim| CP2[2.VALIDATE_TELEMETRY]

    CP2 --> CP3{3.MATCH_PATTERN confianca >= 60%?}
    CP3 -->|Nao| Wait[Aguarda proxima rodada]
    CP3 -->|Sim| CP4{4.EVALUATE_CONTEXT banca OK?}

    CP4 -->|Nao| Abort
    CP4 -->|Sim| CP5[5.RESOLVE_CONSENSUS]

    CP5 --> CP6{6.CALCULATE_CONVICTION empate?}
    CP6 -->|Sim| Blue[Forca AZUL empate-inverte]
    CP6 -->|Nao| Invert[Inverte azul-vermelho na faixa 50-60 ou 70-78]
    Blue --> CP7
    Invert --> CP7

    CP7{7.SAFETY_CHECK cap R$25?}
    CP7 -->|Acima| Abort
    CP7 -->|OK| DecisaoFinal[action: BET color: AZUL amount: R$5]

    DecisaoFinal --> Armar[armarDecisao + countdown 5s]
    Armar --> Exec[Executor.executarAposta]
    Exec --> Delay[Delay 300-800ms anti-bot]
    Delay --> ChipDet{ChipDetector achou ficha?}
    ChipDet -->|Nao 100%| Fallback[FALLBACK HEURISTICO coords fixas 207,415 e 733,415 BUG]
    ChipDet -->|Sim| Chip[Seleciona ficha real]
    Chip --> Click[Click sintetico y=78%]
    Fallback --> Click

    Click --> Confirm{bet-confirmation 10s saldo decrementou?}
    Confirm -->|Nao 100% atual| Retry[APOSTA NAO ENTROU saldo inalterado]
    Confirm -->|Sim| Armed[Aposta confirmada]

    Armed --> DealerWS{WS resultado chegou?}
    DealerWS -->|Nao| DealerWS
    DealerWS -->|Sim| Result{Resultado = AZUL?}

    Result -->|Sim| Win[VITORIA]
    Result -->|Nao| Loss[Derrota]

    Win --> Toast[overlay.js toast verde +R$5 lucro - A IMPLEMENTAR]
    Win --> UpdateBoard[Tabuleiro nova linha azul]
    Win --> Sync[popup atualiza saldo bug GET_GAME_DATA]
    Win --> Trigger[Mensagem de incentivo - A IMPLEMENTAR]

    Loss --> Gale{Gale ativo?}
    Gale -->|Sim| NextRound[Proxima rodada com stake dobrado max 2 gales]
    Gale -->|Nao| WaitWS

    Toast --> WaitWS
    Sync --> WaitWS
    Retry --> WaitWS

